+# Northwind Traders
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Go-live | 2026-W44 (contract: `docs/NORTHWIND_SOW.md`) |
+| Grain / timezone | 30 minutes / America/Chicago (DST: fall-back Sunday 2026-11-01, W44 has 338 intervals) |
+| Operating hours | 06:00-24:00 local, seven days; `vip` 08:00-20:00 |
+| Queues | priority (90/30), standard (80/20), vip (90/20); occupancy cap 0.85 |
+| Config | `configs/northwind.yaml` (schema 1) |
+| Roster | `data/agents/northwind.csv`, 51 agents (8 part-time); 11 hold the vip skill |
+| Data | `data/northwind/export_<ISO>.csv`, local time with `utc_offset` per row (see its README) |
+| Scheduler | `weekly` (SOW 2.1-2.6); weekly attainment target 0.95 per queue, hours <= 1.57 x required |
+
+`python -m wfm run --client northwind --week <ISO>` writes `schedule.csv`, `eval.json`, `RUNBOOK.md` and
+`exceptions.md` under `out/northwind/`. A run takes about 25 s (seeded annealing, deterministic).
+
+What changed for Northwind and the deviations that predate it: `northwind_handover.md` (embedded in `RUNBOOK.md`).
+The vip roster is too small for the 0.95 target; `exceptions.md` records the achievable figure each week.
